#: ../../language/error_codes/E0092.md:1
msgid "E0092"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0092.md:3
msgid "Warning name: `fragile_catch_all`"
msgstr "警告名称：`fragile_catch_all`"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0092.md:5
msgid ""
"A catch-all handler performs cleanup and then re-raises the same error. This "
"pattern is fragile because catch-all handlers will not capture asynchronous "
"cancellation in the future, while cleanup must also run when an operation is "
"cancelled."
msgstr ""
"兜底处理器执行清理后重新抛出同一个错误。这种写法并不稳健，因为将来兜底处理器"
"不会捕获异步取消，而操作被取消时仍需执行清理。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0092.md:10
msgid "Erroneous example"
msgstr "错误示例"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0092.md:12
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"fn operation_that_may_fail() -> Unit raise {\n"
"  fail(\"operation failed\")\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"///|\n"
"pub fn run() -> Unit raise {\n"
"  try operation_that_may_fail() catch {\n"
"    error => {\n"
"      println(\"cleanup\")\n"
"      raise error\n"
"    }\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0092.md:16
msgid ""
"The handler does not recover from or transform the error; it only performs "
"cleanup before propagating it."
msgstr "该处理器不会从错误中恢复或转换错误；它只在继续传播错误之前执行清理。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0092.md:19
msgid "Suggestion"
msgstr "修改建议"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0092.md:21
msgid ""
"Replace the catch-all handler with `errdefer`. The cleanup then runs "
"whenever the following body exits with an error, and the original error is "
"propagated automatically."
msgstr ""
"将兜底处理器替换为 `errdefer`。这样，后续主体因错误退出时就会执行清理，并自动"
"传播原始错误。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0092.md:25
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"fn operation_that_may_fail() -> Unit raise {\n"
"  fail(\"operation failed\")\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"///|\n"
"pub fn run() -> Unit raise {\n"
"  errdefer println(\"cleanup\")\n"
"  operation_that_may_fail()\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0092.md:29
msgid ""
"If the handler must inspect the error, keep that logic in `catch`, but move "
"independent cleanup into `errdefer`."
msgstr ""
"如果处理器必须检查错误，请将该逻辑保留在 `catch` 中，但把独立的清理移到 "
"`errdefer` 中。"
